B.aqK=s(["nun","letter nun","the nun"],t.s)
B.bxP=new A.ds(B.aqK,"N\u016bn (\u0646) \u2014 It is made with the tip of the tongue touching the gum above the upper front teeth, with a hum through the nose. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for N\u016bn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.aAT=s(["ha light","light ha","soft ha","h\u0101"],t.s)
B.bxU=new A.ds(B.aAT,"H\u0101 (\u0647) \u2014 It is made at the bottom of the throat, a light easy breath. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for H\u0101: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.auV=s(["waw","waww","letter waw","the waw"],t.s)
B.byS=new A.ds(B.auV,"W\u0101w (\u0648) \u2014 It is made by rounding the lips. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for W\u0101w: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.aAr=s(["ya","letter ya","the ya"],t.s)
B.bwv=new A.ds(B.aAr,"Y\u0101 (\u064a) \u2014 It is made with the middle of the tongue rising towards the roof of the mouth. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Y\u0101: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
B.aD4=s(["what do you teach","what can you teach","curriculum","what is the academy","about the academy","wasia academy"],t.s)
B.bAH=new A.ds(B.aD4,"Al-Wasia Academy teaches the letters of the Qur\u2019an, one gentle step at a time: 28 letters in 4 units, then 3 more units on short and long vowels, sukun, shaddah, tanween and joining letters into words, each unit ending with an exam. There are also word decks, tajweed cards, and a du\u2019a school in the Academy. Which would you like to explore \u2014 letters, words, or du\u2019as?")
B.aBk=s(["how many lessons","how many letters","how long","how many units","structure"],t.s)
B.byz=new A.ds(B.aBk,"The letters school has 40 lessons in 7 units \u2014 Unit 1 \u201cThe First Letters\u201d, Unit 2 \u201cThe Middle Letters\u201d, Unit 3 \u201cThe Deep Letters\u201d, Unit 4 \u201cThe Final Letters\u201d (the 28 letters, 7 lessons each), then Unit 5 \u201cShort and Long Vowels\u201d, Unit 6 \u201cSukun, Shaddah and Tanween\u201d and Unit 7 \u201cJoining Letters into Words\u201d. One short lesson a day is a beautiful pace. Would you like to know what today\u2019s lesson could be?")
B.axZ=s(["unit 1","first letters","exam 1"],t.s)
B.bxB=new A.ds(B.axZ,"Unit 1 \u2014 \u201cThe First Letters\u201d \u2014 is the first 7 lessons of the letters school, and it ends with the Unit 1 exam: 10 questions, pass mark 7. The exam gently checks the letter shapes and names. Is your student ready to try the first unit?")
B.ayR=s(["unit 2","middle letters","exam 2"],t.s)
B.bBj=new A.ds(B.ayR,"Unit 2 \u2014 \u201cThe Middle Letters\u201d \u2014 lessons 8 to 14, ending with the Unit 2 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). It builds directly on Unit 1, so the letters from the first unit keep appearing. Shall we check how Unit 1 went first?")
B.aMc=s(["unit 3","deep letters","exam 3"],t.s)
B.byw=new A.ds(B.aMc,"Unit 3 \u2014 \u201cThe Deep Letters\u201d \u2014 lessons 15 to 21, ending with the Unit 3 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). These letters come from deeper in the mouth and throat, so they take a little more practice \u2014 and that is completely normal. Which deep letter is hardest right now?")
B.atH=s(["unit 4","final letters","exam 4","last unit"],t.s)
B.bzH=new A.ds(B.atH,"Unit 4 \u2014 \u201cThe Final Letters\u201d \u2014 the last 7 lessons, ending with the Unit 4 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). After this exam the whole alphabet is known, and the word decks are the next adventure. How far along is your student?")
B.aP3=s(["exam","unit test","letter test","quiz","how do exams work","pass mark"],t.s)
B.bxl=new A.ds(B.aP3,"Each unit ends with a small exam: 10 gentle questions about the letter shapes and names, and a student passes with 7 correct. It is not a judgement \u2014 it only shows which letters want one more visit. In the Family Wing you can see every exam result for each child. Would you like to know where the Family Wing is?")
B.aud=s(["struggling","hard time","difficult","can\u2019t remember","cant remember","keeps forgetting","frustrated","gave up"],t.s)
B.bA4=new A.ds(B.aud,"Struggling with a letter is not failure \u2014 it is the letter asking for one more gentle meeting. Keep the lessons short: five minutes of looking, saying, and hearing beats an hour of pushing. Praise the effort, not the result \u2014 children learn letters the way they learn walking. Which letter is being stubborn today?")
B.aAa=s(["joining","connected","letters together","join letters"],t.s)
B.bwN=new A.ds(B.aAa,"Letters change their shape a little when they join into words \u2014 that is the next skill after the alphabet is known. The word decks in the Academy practice exactly that: real words from the Qur\u2019an, slowly. Has your student finished all four units yet?")
B.aRi=s(["add a child","new child","register my child","create profile","family wing"],t.s)
B.bAr=new A.ds(B.aRi,"Open the Academy and go to the Family Wing \u2014 there you add each child with a first name or nickname, and the Academy keeps their lessons and exams for them on this device only. Their names and progress are never sent to any server or AI service, and you can delete a child at any time. Would you like me to walk you through what the Family Wing shows?")
B.awo=s(["progress","how is my child doing","report","how do i see","track"],t.s)
B.bxZ=new A.ds(B.awo,"The Family Wing in the Academy shows each child\u2019s lessons completed and exam results \u2014 it updates as they learn. You can open it any time and see exactly where your child stands. What would you like to practise with them first?")
B.aME=s(["homeschool","teach at home","classroom","teacher","pedagogy","sequence"],t.s)
B.bvx=new A.ds(B.aME,"For teaching at home: one short lesson a day, letters in the Academy\u2019s order (they are sequenced the classical Qaida way), review yesterday\u2019s letter before the new one, and celebrate small wins loudly. Exams come at the end of each unit \u2014 give them when the child feels ready, not before. How old is your student?")
B.aDB=s(["three voices","personas","student voice","parent voice","teacher voice","who are you"],t.s)
B.bwJ=new A.ds(B.aDB,"I am Wasia, the teacher of the letters school \u2014 the Academy is named after the founder\u2019s daughter. I speak in three voices: with students I teach letters, with parents I explain progress and encourage, and with teachers and homeschoolers I share how to sequence the lessons. Which voice do you need today?")
B.aQs=s(["tajweed","pronunciation","makhraj","sound of"],t.s)
B.bzI=new A.ds(B.aQs,"Tajweed means giving every letter its right \u2014 its own sound and its own place in the mouth. The letters school shows each letter\u2019s name, shape and where it is made, but it cannot yet play the sound: to hear a letter, ask a teacher you trust or listen to a recitation in the app. The Tajweed Cards in the Academy practice the rules step by step. Would you like to start with the letters first?")
B.aPd=s(["word deck","quran words","arabic words","practice words","vocabulary"],t.s)
B.byy=new A.ds(B.aPd,"The Word Deck in the Academy shows real words from the Qur\u2019an with the verse each one comes from. Its meanings are not verified yet, so it does not show a meaning until a named source backs it \u2014 read each word in its verse. It is a gentle next step after the 28 letters are known. Has your student met all seven units yet?")
B.aqc=s(["no sound","audio not working","hear it","listening","hear the letter","play the letter"],t.s)
B.bvE=new A.ds(B.aqc,"The letter lessons do not play a recording of each letter yet \u2014 they show the letter, its name and how it is made, and you say it out loud. A teacher you trust can say it with you, and recitation in the Quran section can be played. If the app's tap sounds are off, the settings screen has the sound toggle. Shall we meet one letter together now?")
B.aNc=s(["where can i learn about","teach me about","school for","academy school","what schools","more schools"],t.s)
B.bxT=new A.ds(B.aNc,"The Academy holds twenty-one schools covering every subject \u2014 prayer, Arabic, du'as, stories, character, family life, and more. Open the Academy home from the gate to see them all. For your letters, stay here with me \u2014 but for anything beyond, there is a school for it.")
B.aNJ=s(["q&a","questions and answers","faq","frequently asked","common questions"],t.s)
B.bzo=new A.ds(B.aNJ,"The Q&A Bank in the Academy answers the twelve questions every Muslim asks \u2014 fasting, mortgages, missed prayers, and more, all with their sources. Shall we get back to your letters?")
B.aDd=s(["duas for","where are the duas","hisn","fortress","morning duas","evening duas"],t.s)
B.bxY=new A.ds(B.aDd,"Hisn al-Muslim in the Academy holds every authentic dua \u2014 morning and evening, for travel, for hardship, for protection. The Du'a School teaches what they mean. Shall I tell you about the one for today?")
